# 默认忽略所有文件，只允许公开代码、文档与年报元信息。
/*
!/.gitignore
!/.gitattributes
!/README.md
!/requirements.txt
!/代码/
/代码/*
!/代码/*.py
!/docs/
/docs/*
!/docs/*.md
!/tools/
/tools/*
!/tools/check_public_files.py
!/.githooks/
/.githooks/*
!/.githooks/pre-commit
!/data/
/data/*
!/data/annual_reports/
/data/annual_reports/*
!/data/annual_reports/README.md
!/data/annual_reports/annual_report_index.csv
# 任何路径都不跟踪密钥、缓存或本地配置。
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
__pycache__/
*.pyc
